            <ArticleTitle>Dark side of drug-eluting stent: multiple stent fractures and sudden death.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e125-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Recently reported stent fractures after sirolimus-eluting stent (SES) implantation were found several months later during the follow-up of coronary angiogram (CAG) and single fracture mostly. The study reports a case of sequential, continuous, multiple coronary stent fracture and sudden death.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
